Package: pdmS7
Type: Package
Title: Configurable Probability Distributed Rainfall Runoff Model
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: person("PDM", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email =
        "pdm@example.org")
Description: An independent, configurable implementation of the Probability Distributed
        Model described by Moore (2007) <doi:10.5194/hess-11-483-2007>. S7 components
        provide five capacity distributions, three recharge schemes, reservoir routing,
        PACK snow processing, multi-objective calibration, and forecast updating.
        Explicit water accounting and source notes
        distinguish numerical choices from the paper.
URL: https://jonpayneea.github.io/PDMS7/, https://github.com/JonPayneEA/PDMS7
BugReports: https://github.com/JonPayneEA/PDMS7/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
